ruby="base">免</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.589" end="1:54.066">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.066" end="1:54.348">ん</span></span></span><span begin="1:54.348" end="1:54.739">じ</span><span begin="1:54.739" end="1:55.168">て</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.550" end="1:55.933">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.933" end="1:56.357">く</span></span></span><span begin="1:56.357" end="1:56.717">を</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">許</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.717" end="1:56.917">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.917" end="1:57.389">る</span></span></span><span begin="1:57.389" end="1:57.866">そ</span><span begin="1:57.866" end="1:59.298">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上原谅我吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, I&apos;ll forgive myself</span></p><p begin="2:00.205" end="2:04.850" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">信</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.205" end="2:00.505">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.505" end="2:00.664">ん</span></span></span><span begin="2:00.664" end="2:00.895">じ</span><span begin="2:00.895" end="2:01.284">る</span><span begin="2:01.284" end="2:01.498">か</span><span begin="2:01.498" end="2:01.890">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">裏</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.267" end="2:02.645">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.645" end="2:03.075">ら</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">切</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.075" end="2:03.283">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="2:03.283" end="2:03.683">ら</span><span begin="2:03.683" end="2:03.880">れ</span><span begin="2:03.880" end="2:04.850">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为付出信任才会惨遭背叛 / Because I believe, I get betrayed</span></p><p begin="2:06.400" end="2:10.738" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">期</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.400" end="2:06.589">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">待</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.589" end="2:06.814">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.814" end="2:06.966">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:06.966" end="2:07.250">す</span><span begin="2:07.250" end="2:07.679">る</span><span begin="2:08.591" end="2:08.983">か</span><span begin="2:08.983" end="2:09.351">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">傷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.351" end="2:09.570">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.570" end="2:09.933">ず</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.933" end="2:10.132">つ</span><span begin="2:10.132" end="2:10.738">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为心有期待才会受伤 / Because I hope, I get hurt</span></p><p begin="2:12.931" end="2:17.119" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.931" end="2:13.086">わ</span><span begin="2:13.086" end="2:13.338">か</span><span begin="2:13.338" end="2:13.526">っ</span><span begin="2:13.526" end="2:13.924">て</span><span begin="2:13.924" end="2:14.129">て</span><span begin="2:14.129" end="2:14.509">も</span> <span begin="2:14.901" end="2:15.291">や</span><span begin="2:15.291" end="2:15.688">め</span><span begin="2:15.688" end="2:15.892">ら</span><span begin="2:15.892" end="2:16.305">れ</span><span begin="2:16.305" end="2:16.499">な</span><span begin="2:16.499" end="2:17.119">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">哪怕心里都明白却还是无法作罢 / Even if I get it, I can&apos;t stop</span></p><p begin="2:19.242" end="2:23.582" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.242" end="2:19.424">ど</span><span begin="2:19.424" end="2:19.653">っ</span><span begin="2:19.653" end="2:19.861">か</span><span begin="2:19.861" end="2:20.436">で</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.825" end="2:21.220">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.220" end="2:21.519">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:21.519" end="2:22.009">し</span><span begin="2:22.009" end="2:22.209">て</span><span begin="2:22.209" end="2:22.597">る</span><span begin="2:22.597" end="2:22.855">か</span><span begin="2:22.855" end="2:23.582">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只因爱意仍在隐隐地涌动 / Because somewhere deep down, I still love them all</span></p><p begin="2:24.411" end="2:30.279" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">痛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.411" end="2:24.783">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.783" end="2:25.171">た</span></span></span><span begin="2:25.171" end="2:25.399">み</span><span begin="2:25.399" end="2:25.737">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">知</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.854" end="2:26.347">し</span></span></span><span begin="2:26.347" end="2:26.915">る</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">者</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.507" end="2:27.937">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.937" end="2:28.344">の</span></span></span><span begin="2:28.344" end="2:28.522">で</span><span begin="2:28.522" end="2:28.996">な</span><span begin="2:29.135" end="2:29.493">い</span><span begin="2:29.493" end="2:30.279">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">从来不曾经历过痛苦的人 / Only someone who knows that pain</span></p><p begin="2:30.511" end="2:37.978" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">泣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.511" end="2:30.671">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:30.671" end="2:30.889">き</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">声</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.889" end="2:31.071">ご</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.071" end="2:31.491">え</span></span></span><span begin="2:31.491" end="2:31.756">の</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">周</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.756" end="2:32.359">しゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">波</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.359" end="2:32.934">は</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">数</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.934" end="2:33.481">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:33.481" end="2:33.831">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:33.831" end="2:34.157">は</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">拾</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.157" end="2:36.216">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.216" end="2:36.668">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="2:36.668" end="2:36.995">え</span><span begin="2:36.995" end="2:37.201">な</span><span begin="2:37.201" end="2:37.978">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">根本就难以捕捉到哭声的频率 / Can pick up the frequencies of crying voices</span></p><p begin="2:39.609" end="2:45.655" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.609" end="2:40.156">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.156" end="2:40.530">ら</span></span></span><span begin="2:40.530" end="2:40.962">に</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">免</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.962" end="2:41.336">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:41.336" end="2:41.698">ん</span></span></span><span begin="2:41.698" end="2:42.138">じ</span><span begin="2:42.138" end="2:42.588">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.925" end="2:43.342">きょ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.342" end="2:43.717">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:43.717" end="2:44.132">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.132" end="2:44.311">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:44.311" end="2:44.932">き</span><span begin="2:44.932" end="2:45.280">よ</span><span begin="2:45.280" end="2:45.655">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便活下去吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s live out today</span></p><p begin="2:45.964" end="2:51.975" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.964" end="2:46.482">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.482" end="2:46.864">ら</span></span></span><span begin="2:46.864" end="2:47.274">に</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">免</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.274" end="2:47.524">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:47.524" end="2:48.019">ん</span></span></span><span begin="2:48.019" end="2:48.443">じ</span><span begin="2:48.443" end="2:48.945">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.242" end="2:49.631">きょ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.631" end="2:50.017">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:50.017" end="2:50.254">は</span><span begin="2:50.254" end="2:50.613">しゃ</span><span begin="2:50.613" end="2:51.223">が</span><span begin="2:51.223" end="2:51.607">も</span><span begin="2:51.607" end="2:51.975">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便蹲下休息吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s curl up into a ball for today</span></p><p begin="2:52.341" end="2:58.244" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">震</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.341" end="2:52.802">ふ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.802" end="2:53.171">る</span></span></span><span begin="2:53.171" end="2:53.592">え</span><span begin="2:53.592" end="2:53.812">て</span><span begin="2:53.812" end="2:54.385">る</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="2"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.385" end="2:54.744">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.744" end="2:55.526">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.526" end="2:55.960">ろ</span></span></span> <span begin="2:56.247" end="2:56.756">そ</span><span begin="2:56.756" end="2:57.000">ば</span><span begin="2:57.000" end="2:57.530">に</span><span begin="2:57.530" end="2:57.890">い</span><span begin="2:57.890" end="2:58.244">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">请给予这颗颤抖的心陪伴吧 / My shivering heart, I&apos;m by your side</span></p><p begin="2:58.626" end="3:05.655" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.626" end="2:59.103">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.103" end="2:59.509">ら</span></span></span><span begin="2:59.509" end="2:59.909">に</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">免</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.909" end="3:00.256">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:00.256" end="3:00.645">ん</span></span></span><span begin="3:00.645" end="3:01.074">じ</span><span begin="3:01.074" end="3:01.504">て</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.864" end="3:02.239">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.239" end="3:02.634">く</span></span></span><span begin="3:02.634" end="3:03.073">を</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">許</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.073" end="3:03.322">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.322" end="3:03.738">る</span></span></span><span begin="3:03.738" end="3:04.222">そ</span><span begin="3:04.222" end="3:05.655">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上原谅我吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, I&apos;ll forgive myself</span></p><p begin="3:18.008" end="3:23.975" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="2"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.008" end="3:18.446">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.446" end="3:18.867">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.867" end="3:19.115">り</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">降</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:19.115" end="3:19.645">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="3:19.645" end="3:19.875">り</span><span begin="3:19.875" end="3:20.162">そ</span><span begin="3:20.162" end="3:20.618">そ</span><span begin="3:20.618" end="3:21.008">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">人</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.175" end="3:21.325">じ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.325" end="3:21.524">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.524" end="3:21.733">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.733" end="3:21.974">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:21.974" end="3:22.402">じゃ</span><span begin="3:22.402" end="3:22.644">な</span><span begin="3:22.644" end="3:23.018">い</span><span begin="3:23.018" end="3:23.975">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我的人生从来都没有光芒的眷顾 / It&apos;s not a life where the light shines upon me</span></p><p begin="3:24.391" end="3:30.375" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="2"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.391" end="3:24.781">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.781" end="3:25.157">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:25.157" end="3:25.551">だ</span></span></span><span begin="3:25.551" end="3:25.959">に</span><span begin="3:25.959" end="3:26.350">ま</span><span begin="3:26.350" end="3:26.558">み</span><span begin="3:26.558" end="3:26.935">れ</span><span begin="3:26.935" end="3:27.335">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.526" end="3:27.924">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">去</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.924" end="3:28.309">こ</span></span></span><span begin="3:28.309" end="3:28.717">も</span><span begin="3:28.717" end="3:28.932">あ</span><span begin="3:28.932" end="3:29.329">る</span><span begin="3:29.329" end="3:30.375">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">曾经也有过被泪水浸透的过往 / I have a past covered in tears too</span></p><p begin="3:30.496" end="3:36.586" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.496" end="3:30.670">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:30.670" end="3:30.903">き</span><span begin="3:30.903" end="3:31.082">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:31.082" end="3:31.506">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">味</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:31.506" end="3:31.685">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:31.685" end="3:32.276">な</span><span begin="3:32.276" end="3:32.661">ん</span><span begin="3:32.661" end="3:33.415">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.801" end="3:34.222">り</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">由</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.222" end="3:34.613">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.613" end="3:34.869">う</span></span></span><span begin="3:34.869" end="3:35.435">な</span><span begin="3:35.435" end="3:35.840">ん</span><span begin="3:35.840" end="3:36.586">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">所谓活着的意义 还有理由之类的 / It&apos;s completely natural to not understand</span></p><p begin="3:36.967" end="3:44.076" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:36.967" end="3:37.381">わ</span><span begin="3:37.381" end="3:37.809">か</span><span begin="3:37.809" end="3:38.225">ら</span><span begin="3:38.225" end="3:38.576">な</span><span begin="3:38.576" end="3:38.815">く</span><span begin="3:38.815" end="3:39.388">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">当</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:39.388" end="3:39.781">あ</span></span></span><span begin="3:39.781" end="3:40.174">た</span><span begin="3:40.174" end="3:40.561">り</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">前</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:40.561" end="3:42.920">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:42.920" end="3:43.335">え</span></span></span><span begin="3:43.335" end="3:43.535">だ</span><span begin="3:43.535" end="3:44.076">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">搞不懂这些才是人之常情吧 / Things like &quot;the meaning of life&quot; or &quot;the reason to live&quot;</span></p><p begin="3:49.043" end="3:55.116" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:49.043" end="3:49.647">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:49.647" end="3:50.000">ら</span></span></span><span begin="3:50.000" end="3:50.441">に</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">免</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:50.441" end="3:50.734">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:50.734" end="3:51.172">ん</span></span></span><span begin="3:51.172" end="3:51.588">じ</span><span begin="3:51.588" end="3:52.052">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:52.385" end="3:52.799">きょ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:52.799" end="3:53.167">う</span></span></span><span begin="3:53.167" end="3:53.598">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:53.598" end="3:53.784">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:53.784" end="3:54.388">き</span><span begin="3:54.388" end="3:54.781">よ</span><span begin="3:54.781" end="3:55.116">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便活下去吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s live out today</span></p><p begin="3:55.473" end="4:01.444" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:55.473" end="3:55.959">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:55.959" end="3:56.346">ら</span></span></span><span begin="3:56.346" end="3:56.721">に</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">免</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:56.721" end="3:57.080">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:57.080" end="3:57.488">ん</span></span></span><span begin="3:57.488" end="3:57.910">じ</span><span begin="3:57.910" end="3:58.284">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.698" end="3:59.077">きょ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:59.077" end="3:59.493">う</span></span></span><span begin="3:59.493" end="3:59.885">は</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">帰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:59.885" end="4:00.128">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:00.128" end="4:00.681">え</span></span></span><span begin="4:00.681" end="4:01.054">ろ</span><span begin="4:01.054" end="4:01.444">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上今天便回去吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, Let&apos;s go back home today</span></p><p begin="4:01.827" end="4:07.735" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:01.827" end="4:02.271">ひ</span><span begin="4:02.271" end="4:02.665">び</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">割</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:02.665" end="4:03.078">わ</span></span></span><span begin="4:03.078" end="4:03.286">れ</span><span begin="4:03.286" end="4:03.850">た</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="2"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:03.850" end="4:04.256">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:04.256" end="4:05.035">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:05.035" end="4:05.364">ろ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">繋</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:05.364" end="4:05.804">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:05.804" end="4:06.208">な</span></span></span><span begin="4:06.208" end="4:06.390">ぎ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">止</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:06.390" end="4:07.011">と</span></span></span><span begin="4:07.011" end="4:07.371">め</span><span begin="4:07.371" end="4:07.735">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">勉强维系着一颗支离破碎的心 / I&apos;m binding back my cracked heart together</span></p><p begin="4:08.108" end="4:15.204" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:08.108" end="4:08.590">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:08.590" end="4:08.967">ら</span></span></span><span begin="4:08.967" end="4:09.393">に</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">免</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:09.393" end="4:09.768">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:09.768" end="4:10.107">ん</span></span></span><span begin="4:10.107" end="4:10.536">じ</span><span begin="4:10.536" end="4:10.906">て</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:11.355" end="4:11.693">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:11.693" end="4:12.124">く</span></span></span><span begin="4:12.124" end="4:12.531">を</span><span tts:ruby="container" amll:empty-beat="1"><span tts:ruby="base">許</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:12.531" end="4:12.733">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:12.733" end="4:13.176">る</span></span></span><span begin="4:13.176" end="4:13.639">そ</span><span begin="4:13.639" end="4:15.204">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看在天空的份上原谅我吧 / For the skies&apos; sake, I&apos;ll forgive myself</span></p></div></body></tt>